# Pharmacy price registry (предельные цены)

## Flow

1. Sync (cron 03:00 or `POST /pharmacy/price-registry/sync`) downloads Excel → snapshot + rows.
2. Journal rows show **old → limit → new** with status `PENDING|APPLIED|SKIPPED_OK|UNMATCHED`.
3. Price drop only after `POST /pharmacy/price-registry/apply` (or `auto-apply=true`).
4. POS checkout calls `PriceLimitSaleValidator.checkPriceBeforeSale` → `PriceLimitExceededException` if above limit.

## Match

Barcode first (`products.barcode` / `product_barcodes`), then Pharm ID = `products.external_product_id`.
